OL,3,ALindsay Clancy trial hangs in balance
OL,4,Aas defence fights to stop judge
OL,5,Adeclaring a mistrial
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge in the trial of Lindsay
OL,8,FClancy - the US mother accused of
OL,9,Fmurdering her three children - says he
OL,10,Fintends to declare a mistrial
OL,12,FIt comes after the jury said "with a
OL,13,Fheavy heart" they were "unable to come
OL,14,Fto a unanimous decision"
OL,16,FClancy and her lawyer have a last-ditch
OL,17,Fappeal hearing before a higher court in
OL,18,Fan attempt to prevent a mistrial
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
